Heat resistance is important because the firetraps in Genhennom will
take off maximum hit points without it, and the lava of the plane of
fire will be instantly fatal if stumbled into.

Cold resistance takes the bite out of Baalzebub.  Sleep resistance is
obviously important.

Shock resistance, however, doesn't really matter for much if you have
reflection.  But poison resistance is one of the most important
intrinsics in the game, yes he definitely needs this.

